# recon-ng lab — komandoak (v5.1.2)

```text
workspaces create nire_helburua
marketplace install recon/domains-hosts/hackertarget
marketplace install recon/domains-hosts/certificate_transparency
marketplace install reporting/csv
modules load recon/domains-hosts/hackertarget
options set SOURCE example.com
run
show hosts
back
modules load reporting/csv
options set FILENAME /path/to/hosts.csv
options set TABLE hosts
options set HEADERS True
run
```

Oharra: v5-ean ez dago `db export csv`. Erabili `reporting/csv`.
